        "TileImage": "$($repository 103ea50a-6d9c-4c51-bf9f-0935d2c27b58).Image",
        "Description": "Sapienza. Daylight. Bloodshed. Fishermen have been chatting on the docks and there&apos;s a womanizing golf instructor traipsing around the majestic villa. While Sapienza residents enjoy ice cold gelati, one philandering Roberto is swinging his way into seaside peril. Do not allow this ponce-about-town to be the plague doctor of Sapienza&apos;s shapely innocents. This will be the last time Francesca or Marina ask for Roberto. Shoot thrill; hunt to kill.",
